  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing TIP Victim Services Program: Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHI is supporting the establishment and institutionalization of a national referral mechanism in Liberia through educational roundtables that bring together key officials to develop and promote standard operating procedures for victim identification and referral. Additionally, WHI is enhancing victim protection efforts in Liberia by providing short-term emergency shelter and holistic case management and reintegration assistance for up to 50 victims of trafficking, and developing a national anti-trafficking hotline.</narrative>
  </description>
